OL,3,GNEWSA'No active plans' for lido
OL,4,Aredevelopment
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are "no active redevelopment
OL,7,Fproposals" for an outdoor pool that has
OL,8,Ffallen into disrepair since closing in
OL,9,Fthe mid-1990s, a council has said.
OL,11,FLocal campaign group Friends of
OL,12,FTynemouth Pool has been calling for the
OL,13,Freopening of the lido in the North
OL,14,FTyneside town for more than a decade,
OL,15,Fbut earlier this year costs were put at
OL,16,Fabout #25m.
OL,18,FThe organisation has welcomed a
OL,19,Fgovernment announcement made this week
OL,20,Fabout the creation of a fund to support
OL,21,Fthe return of outdoor swimming
OL,22,Ffacilities nationally.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
