OL,3,GNEWSA'No active plans' for lido
OL,4,Aredevelopment
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, North Tyneside Council said it
OL,7,Fwas "too early to speculate" on what
OL,8,Fthat could mean for Tynemouth and
OL,9,Freiterated its focus was on "ensuring
OL,10,Fthe site is safe and secure".
